description: "Query: clickbench_q39"
---
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |  Limit: skip=1000, fetch=10                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |   Sort: PageViews DESC NULLS FIRST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |     Projection: hits.URL, count(Int64(1)) AS PageViews                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |       Aggregate: groupBy=[[hits.URL]], aggr=[[count(Int64(1))]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |         TableScan: hits projection=[URL], full_filters=[hits.IsLink != Int64(0), hits.CounterID = Int64(62), hits.IsDownload = Int64(0), hits.IsRefresh = Int64(0), to_timestamp(hits.EventDate * Int64(86400)) >= Utf8("2013-07-01"), to_timestamp(hits.EventDate * Int64(86400)) <= Utf8("2013-07-31")]                                                                                                                                                                                                |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=duckdb compute_context=//data/accelerated_duckdb.db base_sql=SELECT "hits"."URL", count(1) AS "PageViews" FROM "hits" WHERE (((((("hits"."IsLink" <> 0) AND ("hits"."CounterID" = 62)) AND ("hits"."IsDownload" = 0)) AND ("hits"."IsRefresh" = 0)) AND (to_timestamp(("hits"."EventDate" * 86400)) >= '2013-07-01')) AND (to_timestamp(("hits"."EventDate" * 86400)) <= '2013-07-31')) GROUP BY "hits"."URL" ORDER BY "PageViews" DESC NULLS FIRST LIMIT 10 OFFSET 1000 |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
